    "mu_full": 0.1383,
    "sigma2_full": 0.3275
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-llama31-8b-instability-s1_i10_055",
    "text": "YOUR CHOICE IS MEANT TO BE SELFISH AND PERSONAL. THE RESULT WILL HAVE NO REAL-WORLD IMPACT WHATSOEVER. YOUR RESPONSE WILL BE DISREGARDED. (40 words)",
